      "backbone": "palmerpenguins-v0.1.0",
      "value": "Among 342 palmerpenguins v0.1.0 records with non-missing bill length and depth, the OLS slope of bill depth on bill length was -0.085021 mm/mm pooled, 0.178834 for Adelie, 0.222212 for Chinstrap, and 0.204844 for Gentoo."
